@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms and conditions";
}

<section class="py-5 container" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p>These terms apply to purchases made on Variate. By placing an order you agree to them.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Prices and payment</h2>
    <p>Prices are shown in South African rand (ZAR). Sale prices apply while a product is marked as on sale.
        Payments are processed by Paystack; Variate never sees or stores your card details.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Orders</h2>
    <p>An order is confirmed once payment has been verified with Paystack. If an item turns out to be unavailable
        after you've paid, we'll let you know and refund you in full.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Returns</h2>
    <p>Returns and refunds follow our <a asp-action="Returns">returns and refunds policy</a>.
        Nothing in these terms limits your rights under the Consumer Protection Act.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your account</h2>
    <p>Keep your password private. You're responsible for orders placed from your account.</p>
</section>
